  m_Name: AIChatSampleReadme
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _english:
    _title: EasyMic AI Voice Chat
    _summary: A current Unity scaffold for microphone capture, local ASR, Provider-backed
      LLM responses, and local or remote speech synthesis.
    _sections:
    - _heading: Quick Start
      _body: Open Samantha.unity, launch Tools > EasyMic > AI Chat > Setup, complete
        the dependency check, then configure a Provider and save the device API key.
      _linkLabel: 
      _url: 
    - _heading: Audio Setup and First Conversation
      _body: Select VoiceMicrophone to choose the input and ASR model; enable APM/AEC
        for speakers. In Provider Setup choose local speech, select SpeechSynthesizer
        for the model, and keep automatic volume balance on with playback volume 1.
        Save and enter Play Mode. Let the greeting finish in silence, then speak during
        playback to verify interruption. Enable Debug Mode and press F12 when troubleshooting.
      _linkLabel:
      _url:
    - _heading: Core Modules
      _body: VoiceMicrophone handles capture and ASR. AIChatController owns turns
        and orchestration. OpenAI adapters select the Provider contract. ChatTtsPipeline
        generates and plays speech. Plugins add behavior without changing the core
        flow.
      _linkLabel: 
      _url: 
    - _heading: Current Providers
      _body: SiliconFlow uses Qwen/Qwen3.5-9B with CosyVoice2-0.5B. OpenAI uses GPT-5.4
        through the Responses API and gpt-4o-mini-tts with the marin voice. Custom
        OpenAI-compatible hosts use Chat Completions.
      _linkLabel: 
      _url: 
    - _heading: Configuration Contract
      _body: Scene Policy supplies reusable Provider defaults. Schema v4 device JSON
        then supplies persisted Provider, API key, microphone, ASR, and TTS values.
        A key injected before Awake remains the final in-memory credential. Runtime-panel
        Save persists and applies device settings immediately.
      _linkLabel: 
      _url: 
    - _heading: Use as a Scaffold
      _body: Replace the prompt profile, presentation layer, and plugins while keeping
        the controller, request orchestrator, Provider adapter, and TTS pipeline
        boundaries.
      _linkLabel: 
      _url: 
  _chineseSimplified:
    _title: EasyMic AI 语音对话
    _summary: 面向 Unity 的当前版本脚手架，覆盖麦克风采集、本地
      ASR、Provider LLM 回复，以及本地或远程语音合成。
    _sections:
    - _heading: 快速开始
      _body: 打开 Samantha.unity，进入 Tools > EasyMic > AI Chat > Setup，完成依赖检查，然后配置
        Provider 并保存当前设备的 API Key。
      _linkLabel: 
      _url: 
    - _heading: 音频配置与首次对话
      _body: 选择 VoiceMicrophone 设置输入与 ASR 模型，外放时启用 APM/AEC。
        在 Provider 设置中选择本地语音，通过 SpeechSynthesizer 设置模型，保持自动均衡开启、播放音量为 1。
        保存后进入 Play Mode，先保持安静听完问候，再在播放时说话验证打断。
        排查问题时开启 Debug Mode 并按 F12 查看流水线。
      _linkLabel:
      _url:
    - _heading: 核心模块
      _body: VoiceMicrophone 负责采集与 ASR；AIChatController 管理轮次和编排；OpenAI
        适配器选择 Provider 契约；ChatTtsPipeline 生成并播放语音；Plugins
        在不修改核心流程的情况下扩展行为。
      _linkLabel: 
      _url: 
    - _heading: 当前 Provider
      _body: SiliconFlow 使用 Qwen/Qwen3.5-9B 与 CosyVoice2-0.5B；OpenAI 使用
        GPT-5.4 Responses API，以及 gpt-4o-mini-tts 的 marin 音色；其他
        OpenAI 兼容服务使用 Chat Completions。
      _linkLabel: 
      _url: 
    - _heading: 配置契约
      _body: 场景 Policy 提供可复用的 Provider 默认值；schema v4 设备
        JSON 随后应用并保存 Provider、API Key、麦克风、ASR 与 TTS 参数；Awake
        前注入的 Key 是最终内存凭证；运行时面板保存后会立即应用设备设置。
      _linkLabel: 
      _url: 
    - _heading: 作为脚手架
      _body: 可以替换 Prompt Profile、表现层和插件，同时保留 Controller、请求编排、Provider
        适配器及 TTS Pipeline 的边界。
      _linkLabel: 
      _url: 
